Package: whatevr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Native WhatsApp client for Linux
 Whatevr is a Linux-first native client for WhatsApp built around the whatevrd
 background daemon, which owns the WhatsApp connection, local store, media
 cache and notifications, and exposes a local gRPC API. This package ships the
 daemon together with the Qt/Kirigami frontend, whatkevr.
